  "directory_map": {
    "description": "Canonical owner tag for every top-level directory. Enforced by tests/unit/test_architecture_boundaries.py: new top-level directories fail CI until tagged here, and PATH_A code may not import PATH_B or DEPRECATED_ARCHIVE code. Tags follow current dependencies (code wins): core_kernel, financial_digital_twin and utils are PATH_A because core/ and skills/ import them.",
